OL,3,GNEWSAExtra time for police to quiz five
OL,4,Aafter baby death
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive people arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fmurder after the death of a newborn
OL,8,Fbaby girl in Sheffield continue to be
OL,9,Fquestioned, police have said.
OL,11,FA total of seven people aged between 15
OL,12,Fand 37 were originally arrested on
OL,13,FSunday after officers were called to a
OL,14,Fproperty on Holywell Heights in the
OL,15,FWincobank area, following reports of a
OL,16,Fconcern for the safety of an infant.
OL,18,FSouth Yorkshire Police said, despite
OL,19,Fthe best efforts of officers and
OL,20,Fparamedics, the baby was pronounced
OL,21,Fdead at the scene.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
