OL,3,GNEWSAExtra time for police to quiz five
OL,4,Aafter baby death
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo of the seven arrested, aged 26 and
OL,7,F37, were bailed but the force confirmed
OL,8,Fit had obtained a warrant to extend
OL,9,Ftime in custody for the remaining five
OL,10,Fas inquiries continue.
